      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I ran into this problem the other day as well, especially re: not being able to sort the saved search at all. I un-saved a saved search I had because being unable to sort it made it actively less useful than just manually searching every time. Being able to save sorting options with the search would also be great, but being unable to sort saved searches at all seems like a huge oversight.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
