  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-12-18T19:21:29.661Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "One of the reasons I want a Saved World Search is so that I can check new worlds that are created, matching a given theme. However, having a saved search is not effective for this because it doesn't seem to save your sorting options - and then when you click on the saved search, you can't even manually sort the results! I would find this feature a lot more useful if it had those options.",
